title WF02 Research gap analysis (a) - activity
|Researcher|
start
:Enter topic and select\nevidence papers;
:Run gap analysis;
|LumiGap platform|
:Charge credits, queue analysis;
:Retrieve evidence and ask\nthe AI model for gaps;
if (Analysis succeeded?) then ([no])
  :Mark failed and refund credits;
  |Researcher|
  :Retry as a new run\n(new analysis row);
  stop
else ([yes])
endif
|LumiGap platform|
:Store gaps as CANDIDATE\nwith corpus probe counts;
|Researcher|
:Review AI candidate gaps\nand add evidence;
stop
note right
  Expert validation continues
  in activity (b).
end note
@enduml
